WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:10.590
How does life come from randomness? We imagine
the surface of the Earth billions of years

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:19.650
ago was random molten lava. But life is subtle
and complex and requires a lot of structure.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:26.579
How could it be that structure could form
from randomness? If the system you’re looking

00:00:26.579 --> 00:00:36.600
at is isolated, eventually that system will
randomize up to the extent that there's no

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:42.960
interesting structure. It will maximize entropy,
or disorder. So, you wouldn’t expect to

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:49.399
see anything. That’s because if any structure
tried to form, the random motion of the molecules

00:00:49.399 --> 00:00:55.920
would knock apart whatever starts. However,
if you have some other source of energy that

00:00:55.920 --> 00:01:00.940
keeps the system out of equilibrium – again,
the surface of the Earth, but now the Sun

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:07.000
is beating down on it – that extra source
of energy could smash things together and

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:14.050
create structures. Structures that are solid
enough that the little random motions of the

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:20.460
background pieces never disrupt it, or at
least don’t have enough time to. And the

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:25.990
structures could grow and grow. That’s a
nice little cartoon story, but is it true?

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:31.540
Well, recently there have been breakthroughs
in understanding what’s called non-equilibrium

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:39.270
processes. And proposals to explain how structure
can come from these seemingly random systems.

00:01:39.270 --> 00:01:45.560
Those structures could be anything, but of
course one of the most exciting would be:

00:01:45.560 --> 00:01:53.310
Could it be life – RNA molecules and everything
that comes after that. They’re delicate

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:58.090
little beings and you might worry that, put
in a little soup, the random motion would

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:04.200
destroy them. But perhaps they’re not so
delicate. And perhaps they’re even a predictive

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:12.920
consequence of a random Earth but with energy
imposed into the system. That is something

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:19.540
we can’t answer now, but is an exciting
new vein or way of people are thinking about

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:21.580
the problem and hope to solve it.

